## Start here

1. **Developer portal:** https://{{ pelab_hosts.backstage }}. Sign in as guest. It lists the platform's services, the golden path and every team's services.
2. **Your workspace (browser IDE):** https://{{ item }}.{{ pelab_domain }}. It has a terminal, git, kubectl and all the course tools.
3. **Your team's service:** https://{{ pelab_hosts.gitea }}/{{ pelab_workspace_teams[item] | default('<your team>') }}/hello. Sign in as `{{ item }}`. Read the README: it walks you from a change to production.
4. **Your service running in dev:** https://hello-{{ pelab_workspace_teams[item] | default('<team>') }}-dev.{{ pelab_domain }}

In the workspace terminal, `git clone https://{{ pelab_hosts.gitea }}/{{ pelab_workspace_teams[item] | default('<team>') }}/hello.git`
asks for the same username and password. `kubectl get pods` shows your team's dev namespace.

5. **The handbook:** https://{{ pelab_hosts.gitea }}/{{ golden_path_platform_org | default('platform') }}/{{ golden_path_handbook_repo | default('handbook') }}. Every lab, step by step.

