## SSH from Windows (OpenSSH client)

{% if workspaces_provided_keys.results[idx].stat.exists %}
Use the private key that matches `{{ item }}.pub`.
{% else %}
Private key: `{{ generated_key }}` (copy it to `%USERPROFILE%\.ssh\pelab_{{ item }}`).
{% endif %}

Add to `%USERPROFILE%\.ssh\config`:

```
Host pelab-jump
    HostName {{ workspaces_jump_host }}
    User {{ item }}
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/pelab_{{ item }}

Host {{ item }}
    HostName {{ address }}
    User {{ item }}
    ProxyJump pelab-jump
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/pelab_{{ item }}
```

Then connect with `ssh {{ item }}`.
